      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Built: the CLI, gate, the local run store, hooks, the checkpoint manager and forwarder threads (in the trainer process). Checkpoints are built; sync and the server are planned. Client-side alert rules deliver straight to the channels when no server is configured (arrow omitted).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
