      "originalText": "Built: the CLI, gate, the local run store, hooks, the checkpoint manager and forwarder threads (in the trainer process). Checkpoints are built; sync and the server are planned. Client-side alert rules deliver straight to the channels when no server is configured (arrow omitted).",
